Kind: ablation
Issue: #708
Takes out: the timeout's nanoseconds counted in ticks, rounded up, and the count looked at before a zero timeout answers (239e3276, 4d5d42cb) -- tv_nsec / (NSEC_PER_SEC) / hz again, 0 for any timeout under a second, and KERN_OPERATION_TIMED_OUT before the semaphore is locked when the timeout has no whole second in it; cap_test [29] then says WRONG three times, as it did on 11bf7e79 on victus, under KVM and under TCG
Run: --entry 14 600 -smp 4
Expect: cap_test: \[29\] .* -- WRONG \(#708\)

